{
  "slug": "valtown",
  "name": "Valtown",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Build and deploy on Val Town. Bundles the Val Town MCP server and platform skills (HTTP vals, cron/intervals, SQLite, email, OAuth, React UI, third-party integrations, templates).",
  "longDescription": "Ships **11 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (11): `blob-storage` (Use when a val needs simple key/value persistence — JSON documents, cached responses, uploaded files, or binary assets), `client-side-js` (Use when a val needs to ship JavaScript that runs in the browser — React apps, vanilla DOM…), `create-skill` (Use when the user wants to persist a preference, skill, or knowledge), `cron-and-intervals` (Use when building a val that runs on a schedule — periodic jobs, recurring tasks, polling, cron jobs,…), `email` (Use when a val sends email, receives email, or is triggered by an incoming email), `http-endpoints` (Use when building an HTTP val — a web endpoint, API route, webhook receiver, or any val that…), `oauth` (Use when a val needs to require login with a Val Town account — gating routes behind authentication,…), `react-ui` (Use when building any val with a user interface — dashboards, web apps, landing pages, forms, admin tools,…), and 3 more\n- **MCP servers** (1): `valtown`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install valtown@claude-plugins-official` from `val-town/plugins` (`plugin`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
